      "description": "Registers the PoC's closure as `EG(user_error_handler)` and leaves its mask at `E_ALL`, creating the reentrant userland error-handling state that later frees `$a` during the deprecation warning."
    },
    {
      "invariant_id": "r_dynamic_property_deprecation_must_leave_tracked_object_live",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "file": "Zend/zend_object_handlers.c",
      "function": "zend_std_get_property_ptr_ptr",
      "line": 1063,
      "operands": [
        "IS_OBJ_VALID(EG(objects_store).object_buckets[zobj->handle])",
        "true"
      ],
      "relation": {
        "op": "eq",
        "left": "IS_OBJ_VALID(EG(objects_store).object_buckets[zobj->handle])",
        "right": "true"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_dynamic_property_deprecation_must_leave_tracked_object_live",
      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "After `zend_fetch_property_address()` hands the concrete `zobj` and member name into `zend_std_get_property_ptr_ptr()`, `zend_get_property_offset()` classifies the member as a dynamic-property access, there is no existing dynamic slot, and the class has neither `__get` nor `ZEND_ACC_ALLOW_DYNAMIC_PROPERTIES`. On that witnessed path `zend_std_get_property_ptr_ptr()` emits the deprecation via `zend_deprecated_dynamic_property(zobj->ce, name)` and then continues to use `zobj` without pinning or revalidating it. Because the helper receives only `ce` and does not hold a reference across `zend_error()`, the user error handler can destroy the object before control returns. The fix changes this exact call to pass `zobj`, pins it in the helper, and bails out if the callback destroyed it."
    },
    {
      "invariant_id": "e_deprecation_zobj_reaches_properties_read",
      "role": "sink",
      "file": "Zend/zend_object_handlers.c",
      "function": "zend_std_get_property_ptr_ptr",
      "line": 1065,
      "operands": [
        "zobj"
      ],
      "relation": {
        "op": "eq",
        "left": "zobj",
        "right": "zobj"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_deprecation_zobj_reaches_properties_read",
      "fine_trace_step": 16,
      "description": "ASan crash site. After the deprecation handler has freed the only `zend_object`, control returns to `zend_std_get_property_ptr_ptr()` and the next read of `zobj->properties` dereferences freed memory."
    },
